# Root plugin.json and mcp.json are TRACKED: Duckwork portable discovery reads
# exactly those two names (agent_plugins.py: root/plugin.json, root/mcp.json,
# both "must be a regular in-root file"), while the Qoder plugin host reads
# .qoder-plugin/plugin.json and .mcp.json. Both pairs ship, and selfcheck.py
# pins them to one version with mcp.json byte-identical to .mcp.json.
